<title>SYRIA: Syria sells 40,000 tonnes of wheat to Germany.</title>
<headline>Syria sells 40,000 tonnes of wheat to Germany.</headline>
<dateline>DAMASCUS 1997-02-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Syria's General Establishment for Cereal Processing and Trade has sold a German company 40,000 tonnes of hard amber durum wheat at $195 per tonne, a senior GECPT official said on Sunday.</p>
<p>He said the wheat would be ready for shipment in March.</p>
</text>
